        "description_excerpt": "Nut Rush is a relaxing sorting puzzle about unscrewing bolts and organizing colored nuts. It is easy to understand, calm to play, and built around one simple idea: bring order to a colorful mess, one move at a time.<br><br>WHAT THE GAME IS<br>Every level shows a small set of bolts, and each bolt is stacked with nuts of different colors all jumbled together. Your job is to move the nuts around so that, by the end, every bolt holds nuts of just one color. Once all the colors are sorted into neat single-color stacks, the level is complete and you move on to the next one.<br><br>HOW TO PLAY<br>1. Tap a bolt to pick up the nut on top of it.<br>2. Tap another bolt to place that nut down.<br>3. A nut can only be placed on a bolt whose top nut is the same color, or on an empty bolt.<br>4. Keep unscrewing and moving nuts until each bolt is a single solid color to clear the board.<br><br>The rules take only a few seconds to learn, but solving each board takes a little thought. You will need to plan ahead, keep an empty bolt free as breathing room, and decide the right order to move things so you do not get stuck. Every level has a solution — finding the cleanest path is the fun part.<br><...",
